00:13:57.481 --> 00:13:59.970
What was the first to your mind,

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:01.857
like the first writing piece that you did

00:14:01.857 --> 00:14:03.640
that kind of put you on the map?

00:14:03.640 --> 00:14:04.905
Where, not like, I've arrived,

00:14:04.905 --> 00:14:08.724
but like, okay I actually
